# Dependency directories
# Both spellings on purpose. `node_modules/` matches ONLY a directory; a
# `node_modules` SYMLINK (a worktree sharing its dependencies) slips past it
# and gets committed by `git add -A`. That happened on 2026-09-26: the
# committed link pointed at itself after a merge and replaced the real
# directory, and 56 MCP tests went red looking like a broken merge.
# lucky-mem learned this earlier; this is the same line, rebuilt here.
node_modules
node_modules/
jspm_packages/

# Snowpack dependency directory (https://snowpack.dev/)
web_modules/

# TypeScript cache
*.tsbuildinfo

# Optional npm cache directory
.npm

# Optional eslint cache
.eslintcache

